      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470069006D006D0065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I got this little box of joy while sightseeing in the\nPaldea region.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200067006F0074002000740068006900730020006C006900740074006C006500200062006F00780020006F00660020006A006F00790020007700680069006C00650020007300690067006800740073006500650069006E006700200069006E0020007400680065000A00500061006C00640065006100200072006500670069006F006E002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But the thing is, you need Gimmighoul Coins in\norder to evolve a Gimmighoul.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And not just a few—no <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿԆsirreema’am. We’re talking...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00640020006E006F00740020006A0075007300740020006100200066006500772014006E006F002000100003110000FF0506007300690072007200650065006D006120190061006D002E002000570065201900720065002000740061006C006B0069006E0067002E002E002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "999 COINS!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00390039003900200043004F0049004E0053002100100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I haven’t found a single Gimmighoul Coin\nhere in Lumiose City.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020004900200068006100760065006E2019007400200066006F0075006E006400200061002000730069006E0067006C0065002000470069006D006D006900670068006F0075006C00200043006F0069006E000A006800650072006500200069006E0020004C0075006D0069006F0073006500200043006900740079002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Help me out, would you? I’ll let you take my\nGimmighoul with you if you’ll evolve it for me!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can do that",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000630061006E00200064006F002000740068006100740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hold on...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C00640020006F006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seriously? Why are people in Lumiose so cold?\nI’m just trying to share the riches of my travels...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Looks like your Boxes are all full. Let go of one of\nthose other Pokémon for my rare one, won’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Of course you’d wanna spend some time with a\nrare Pokémon like this one—it’s a total gimme!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
